  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-074-wu052-zhangsons:ba" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">八月，<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-074-wu052-zhangsons:ba:m0003" ref="572_278_cba">吳主</persName>封子<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-074-wu052-zhangsons:ba:m0007" ref="572_278_cba_B">霸</persName>為魯王。<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-074-wu052-zhangsons:ba:m0012" ref="572_278_cba_B">霸</persName>，<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-074-wu052-zhangsons:ba:m0014" ref="572_278_cba_A">和</persName>母弟也，寵愛崇特，與<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-074-wu052-zhangsons:ba:m0025" ref="572_278_cba_A">和</persName>無殊。</p>
